[0.005, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m Physics::Body mass changes already\u001b[38Grebuild\u001b[46Gon\u001b[49Gthe\u001b[53Gnext\u001b[58Gstep,\u001b[64Gso\u001b[67Gno\u001b[70Gengine\u001b[77Ggap\u001b[81Gshows\u001b[87Gup\u001b[90Gfor\u001b[94GW08\u001b[98Gso\u001b[101Gfar.\u001b[106GI'd\u001b[110Gsuggest\r\u001b[1B  Opus at\u001b[11Ghigh effort for W08, since its saved purchase\u001b[57Grecord\u001b[64Gand\u001b[68Gnew\u001b[72Gcontent\u001b[80Gfingerprint\u001b[92Gshape\u001b[98Gthe\u001b[102Gsave\u001b[107Gand\u001b[111Gcommand\r\u001b[1B  interface, and I'm continuing\u001b[33Gwith\u001b[38Gthe\u001b[42GManifest\u001b[51Gupgrade\u001b[59Gcode\u001b[64Gnext.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · summary\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[39mSearching for \u001b[1m11\u001b[22m patterns, reading \u001b[1m7\u001b[22m files, running \u001b[1m6\u001b[22m shell commands…\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ sed -n 1,200p '../manifest'/data/tuning/balance.yaml\r\u001b[1B────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B← \u001b[48;2;177;185;249m\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m ☐ Upgrade fit \u001b[19G\u001b[39m\u001b[49m☐\u001b[21GCost/tiers\u001b[33G☐\u001b[35GWhere/payee\u001b[48G☐\u001b[50GHull\u001b[55Gmass\u001b[61G✔\u001b[63GSubmit\u001b[71G→\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mW08's starter (HullLoneTraderStarter, 160 totes) has no CargoHolds slot, and the existing effect adds 2,400 totes a \r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m│\u001b[3G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mtier (sized for the 7,200-tote long-haul trader). How should the first upgrade fit the starter?\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m❯\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m1.\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mSlot, +2,400 as is (Recommended)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mAdd CargoHolds to the starter's fitableEffects and reuse the effect unchanged, as the plan says: 160 → 2,560 totes \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mat tier 1.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m2.\u001b[39m Slot, per-hull am\u001b[24Gunt\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mThe starter gets the slot, but each hull authors its own per-tier increase (a new hull field). The upgrade then \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mstops being the catalogue's effect alone.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m3.\u001b[39m Long-haul hull only\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mLeave the starter without upgrades and prove W08 on a HullTraderLongHaul ship. That needs a dock hull and pad for \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mit, so more work.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m4. Type something.\r\u001b[1B────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  5.\u001b[6GChat\u001b[11Gabout\u001b[17Gthis\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mEnter to select · Tab/Arrow keys to navigate · Esc to cancel\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── jettison-0005 ─\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[13;1H"]
