[0.006, "o", "\u001b[H\r\u001b[7B←  ☒ Upgrade fit \u001b[48;2;177;185;249m\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m ☐ Cost/tiers \r\u001b[3C\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mhat should the scenario offer cost, and how many tiers\u001b[59Gshould it se\u001b[72Gl? Start is\u001b[84G25,000 cr\u001b[94Gdits;\u001b[100GW15's furs\u001b[111Grun ends \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bat 29,590.\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m27,000, tier\u001b[19G1 only (Reco\u001b[32Gmended)\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mUnaffo\u001b[13Gdable at the start, affordable after one complet\u001b[62Gd trade, which prov\u001b[82Gs '\u001b[86G trade fu\u001b[96Gd\u001b[98G it'.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m2.\u001b[6G\u001b[39m4,000 a tier,\u001b[20G3\u001b[22Gtiers\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mAffordable from the start. One trade's ~4,600 profit covers a tier. Exercises the max-tier limit.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3.\u001b[6G\u001b[39m27,000 a tier, 3 tiers\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mThe first tier needs a trade, and the later tiers need more trades.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B4\u001b[5G Type something.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m5.\u001b[6GChat about this\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mEnter to select · Tab/Arrow keys to navigate · Esc to cancel\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[13;1H"]
