[0.082, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[2m 827 \u001b[22m ## Handoff to stage 5\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 828 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 829 \u001b[22m Carry forward the exact scheduler order, command/result schema, content manifest,\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(~/projects/manifest/docs/stage-4-trading-plan.md)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m lines, removed \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m lines\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 475 \u001b[22m - **Ships.** Provisioning parks the starter on the smallest free pad its dock hull fits, the lowest\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 476 \u001b[22m   numbered of those (a skiff pad), as a dynamic body of its hull with its drive, refusing `NoPadFree`\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 477 \u001b[22m   before anything is written. Its engine controller is a player's, slot n of its `Company<n>`\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 478 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  (`ControllerOf`), never reused. `travel` sends every engine command as that controller. \u001b[48;2;92;2;0mshortcut:\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m   \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m 479 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  every ship weighs 20 t, which only collisions feel; W08 authors a hull's mass.                      \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m478\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m \u001b[14G(`ControllerOf`),\u001b[32Gnever\u001b[38Greused.\u001b[46G`travel`\u001b[55Gsends\u001b[61Gevery\u001b[67Gengine\u001b[74Gcommand\u001b[82Gas\u001b[85Gthat\u001b[90Gcontroller.\u001b[102G\u001b[48;2;4;71;0mIt weighs\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 479 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  its hull's authored mass (W08).                                                                     \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[2m 480 \u001b[22m - **The journey.**\u001b[31G`World::Journey`\u001b[48Gon\u001b[51Gthe\u001b[55Gship\u001b[60G(saved):\u001b[69Gthe\u001b[73Gvenue,\u001b[80Gthe\u001b[84Gleg\u001b[88G(`Departing`,\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 481 \u001b[14G\u001b[22m`Clearing`,\u001b[26G`Cruising`,\u001b[38G`Arriving`,\u001b[50Gthen\u001b[55G`Arrived`\u001b[65Gor\u001b[68G`Failed`),\u001b[79Gwhy\u001b[83Git\u001b[86Gfailed,\u001b[94Gand\u001b[98Gthe\u001b[102Gstep\u001b[107Git\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 482 \u001b[22m   st\u001b[17Grted. `Travel` r\u001b[34Gfuses `Unkn\u001b[46GwnTarget`, `NotAuthorised`, `Travelling`\u001b[87Gwhile\u001b[93Gone\u001b[97Gis\u001b[100Gunder\u001b[106Gway\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2BRunn\u001b[11G\u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell com\u001b[25Gd…\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m$ sed -n 474,482p '../manifest/docs/stage-4-trading-plan.md'\r\u001b[16C\u001b[2B15m 25s ·\u001b[27G↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m74.2k tok\u001b[39Gns)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[18C\u001b[6B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to inte\u001b[54Grupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
