[0.165, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[8G\u001b[2m0\u001b[11G\u001b[22mThe starte\u001b[22G ship is the entry\u001b[41Gpoint for a lone trader\u001b[65Gand has a cargo hold of 160 totes\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 11 \u001b[22m (20 m³, a tote being an eighth of a cubic metre, [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mD-087\u001b[39m](decision-ledger.md#d-087)). It is\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 12 \u001b[22m distinct from the new compact 32-tote ship below. 160 totes is the selected starting hold\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 13 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mcapacity; upgrade rules and                                                                            \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m 14 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mother starter specifications remain open.                                                              \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 13 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mcapacity. Its first upgrade is a tier of cargo holds, 2,400 totes more                                 \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 14 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mD-096\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](decision-ledger.md#d-096)); other upgrade rules and starter specifications remain open.       \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[2m5\u001b[11G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 16 \u001b[11G\u001b[22mThe\u001b[15Gsubsequently\u001b[28Gselected\u001b[37Ginitial\u001b[45Gstarter\u001b[53Gsupply\u001b[60Gis\u001b[63G30\u001b[66Gkg\u001b[69Gof\u001b[72Goxygen\u001b[79Gand\u001b[83Gone\u001b[87Gfresh\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[2m 17 \u001b[22m installed standard scrubber cartridge, providing 30\u001b[63Goccupant-days\u001b[77Gof\u001b[80Gscrubbing\u001b[90Gcapacity.\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mListed \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m directory, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command, recalled \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m memory \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m Docs are updated. Running Manifest's full gate (werror, asan, tidy) at full width. Memory is free: 52 GB available.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mstart a cross code review while the gate is running\u001b[39m                                                                   \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mWriting ~/projects/manifest/build/reviews/w08/round-1.prompt\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  Write(~/projects/manifest/build/reviews/w08/round-1.prompt) (2m 31s)\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
