560-tote\u001b[14Ghold. Yet\u001b[24Gno purchase could ever have produced that entry: technology is the civilis\u001b[99Gtion's,\u001b[107Gnot\u001b[112Gomething\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfitted to a ship. Similarly, if a h\u001b[40Gl\u001b[42Ggained a \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mDrydock\u001b[39m slot, a save could carr\u001b[84G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mSkillYardDrydock\u001b[39m, which is\u001b[111Ga shipyard\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Beffect, not\u001b[15Ga ship one. So loading enforced a\u001b[49Glooser rule than buying, which b\u001b[82Geaks the coding standards' \"one rule,\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bone owner\".\u001b[15G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mThe fix:\u001b[12G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mFits\u001b[17G\u001b[39mnow\u001b[21Galso\u001b[26Grequires\u001b[35Geach\u001b[40Gentry\u001b[46Gto\u001b[49Gbe\u001b[52Ga\u001b[54G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mSkill\u001b[60G\u001b[39mnode\u001b[65Gwhose\u001b[71Geffect\u001b[78Gis\u001b[81Ga\u001b[83GShip-domain\u001b[95Geffect\u001b[102Gin\u001b[105Gthe\u001b[109Gcatalogue.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BBuying and loading now\u001b[26Ghold sy\u001b[34Gt\u001b[36Gms to exac\u001b[47Gly the\u001b[54Gsame rule.\u001b[65G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mThe test:\u001b[13G\u001b[22min\u001b[16Gthe\u001b[20Gcompany\u001b[28Gsuite\u001b[34GI\u001b[36Gadded\u001b[42Ga\u001b[44Gvariant\u001b[52Gof\u001b[55Gthe\u001b[59Gcontent\u001b[67Gwith\u001b[72Ga\u001b[74G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mTech\u001b[79G\u001b[39mcopy\u001b[84Gof\u001b[87Gthe\u001b[91Gcargo-holds\u001b[103Gnode,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mTechCargoHolds\u001b[39m. A ship given that entry is s\u001b[75Gs refused wi\u001b[89G \"h\u001b[93Gs system\u001b[103Git cannot\u001b[113Gcarry\".\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
