[3.888, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H  registered: with that registration removed, the old hash returns.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mCross-review (Codex, two rounds):\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m- \u001b[1mRound 1:\u001b[22m three findings, all fixed\u001b[40Gwith\u001b[45Gtests.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G- A save\u001b[14Gcould\u001b[20Gloa\u001b[24G sy\u001b[28Gtems the purchase rules\u001b[52Grefuse.\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1Btiny\u001b[14Gmass such a\u001b[26G \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m1e-100\u001b[39m would become 0 when stored\u001b[61Gas\u001b[64Ga\u001b[66Gfloat.\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BTwo skill\u001b[17G sharing one effect could shrink a loaded hold.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mRound 2:\u001b[22m one\u001b[18Gmore finding, the one I explained\u001b[52Gin my previous\u001b[67Gmessage.\u001b[76GThe\u001b[80Gloading\u001b[88Gcheck\u001b[94Gdidn't\u001b[101Grequire\u001b[109Geach\u001b[114Gsystem\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gto be a ship\u001b[18Gskill. It's fixed\u001b[36Ga\u001b[38Gd\u001b[40Gtested, an\u001b[52Gthe gate ab\u001b[64Gve\u001b[67Gran \u001b[72Gfter that fix. Round 2's verdict was\u001b[109G\"change\u001b[117G\"\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bbecause\u001b[13Git reviewed\u001b[25Gthe tree before this fix, so no review round h\u001b[72Gs seen the final version.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mDecision for you:\u001b[21G\u001b[22mcommit\u001b[28Gas\u001b[31Git\u001b[34Gstands,\u001b[42Gor\u001b[45Grun\u001b[49Ga\u001b[51Gthird\u001b[57Greview\u001b[64Ground\u001b[70Gfirst?\u001b[77GYour\u001b[82Grule\u001b[87Gis\u001b[90Gto\u001b[93Gcommit\u001b[100Gonly\u001b[105Gafter\u001b[111Gan\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bapproving round, and the\u001b[28Gproces\u001b[35G stops\u001b[42Gat\u001b[45Gtwo\u001b[49Grounds unless you extend it. If yo\u001b[84G approve, I'll c\u001b[101Gmmit in Manifest\u001b[118Gand\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bu\u001b[5Gdate Jettison's roadmap \u001b[31Gw (W08 done, W09 next).\u00